{"speciesId":369,"names":{"fr":"Relicanth","es":"Relicanth","en":"Relicanth","ja":"ジーランス"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"RELICANTH is a POKéMON species that existed for a hundred million years without ever changing its form. This ancient POKéMON feeds on microscopic organisms with its toothless mouth."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"RELICANTH is a rare species that was discovered in deep-sea explorations. This POKéMON’s body withstands the enormous water pressure of the ocean depths. Its body is covered in tough scales that are like craggy rocks."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"A POKéMON that was once believed to have been extinct. The species has not changed its form for 100 million years. It walks on the seafloor using its pectoral fins."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It has remained unchanged for 100 million years. It was discovered during a deep-sea exploration."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It has remained unchanged for 100 million years. It was discovered during a deep-sea exploration."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"A rare Pokémon discovered during a deep-sea exploration. It has not changed in over 100 million years."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"A rare Pokémon discovered during a deep-sea exploration. It has not changed in over 100 million years."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"A rare Pokémon discovered during a deep-sea exploration. It has not changed in over 100 million years."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"Discovered by chance during deep-sea explorations, it has not changed since ancient times."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Discovered by chance during deep-sea explorations, it has not changed since ancient times."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Un Pokémon rare aperçu lors d’une exploration sous-marine. Il n’a pas évolué depuis 100 millions d’années."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"A rare Pokémon discovered during a deep-sea exploration. It has not changed in over 100 million years."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Un Pokémon rare aperçu lors d’une exploration sous-marine. Il n’a pas évolué depuis 100 millions d’années."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"A rare Pokémon discovered during a deep-sea exploration. It has not changed in over 100 million years."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"A rare Pokémon discovered during a deep-sea exploration. It has not changed in over 100 million years."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"A rare Pokémon discovered during a deep-sea exploration. It has not changed in over 100 million years."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Relicanth n’a connu aucune évolution depuis 100 millions d’années. Il a été découvert pendant une exploration dans les profondeurs de la mer."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"No ha sufrido ningún cambio desde hace 100 millones de años. Fue descubierto durante una expedición marina."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It has remained unchanged for 100 million years. It was discovered during a deep-sea exploration."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"１億年前から 姿が 変わらない ポケモン。 深海を 調査中に 発見された。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Un Pokémon rare aperçu lors d’une exploration sous-marine. Il n’a pas évolué depuis 100 millions d’années."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Un Pokémon raro descubierto en una exploración marina. No ha cambiado en más de 100 millones de años."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"A rare Pokémon discovered during a deep-sea exploration. It has not changed in over 100 million years."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"深海調査で 発見された 珍しい ポケモン。１億年の あいだ 姿が 変わっていない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Les Relicanth sont une espèce de Pokémon qui a existé pendant 100 millions d’années sans jamais changer de forme. Ce Pokémon antique se nourrit d’organismes microscopiques avec sa bouche édentée."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Relicanth pertenece a una especie de Pokémon que lleva millones de años sin cambiar de forma. Este ancestral Pokémon se alimenta de microorganismos por la boca desdentada que tiene."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Relicanth is a Pokémon species that existed for a hundred million years without ever changing its form. This ancient Pokémon feeds on microscopic organisms with its toothless mouth."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"１億年の 長い 間 まったく 姿が 変わらずに 深海で 暮らしていた ポケモン。 歯の ない 口で 微生物だけを 食べる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Relicanth est une espèce rare découverte pendant des explorations sous-marines. Son corps peut supporter l’énorme pression des profondeurs océaniques. Il est recouvert d’écailles semblables à des pierres."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Relicanth pertenece a una rara especie descubierta al explorar el fondo marino. Es grande y está cubierto de toscas y duras escamas, con las que puede soportar la presión del fondo oceánico."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Relicanth is a rare species that was discovered in deep-sea explorations. This Pokémon’s body withstands the enormous water pressure of the ocean depths. Its body is covered in tough scales that are like craggy rocks."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"深海 調査で 発見された 珍種。 ごつごつした 岩の ような うろこで 覆われ 海底の 水圧に 耐える 体を 持つ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Il n’a pas changé d’apparence en 100 millions d’années. La densité de sa couche graisseuse l’aide à supporter la pression des grands fonds."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"No ha cambiado de aspecto en 100 millones de años. Su gruesa capa de grasa le permite soportar la presión abisal."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"Its form has remained the same for one hundred million years. Its body is filled with fat, so it can withstand the water pressure of the deep sea."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"約１億年前から 同じ 姿。 体内が 脂まみれ なので 深海の 水圧に 耐えられる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Il a été découvert complètement par hasard au fin fond de l’océan. Sa dentition déplorable le contraint à se nourrir de micro-organismes."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Fue descubierto de forma accidental durante unas exploraciones marinas. No tiene dientes, por lo que se alimenta de microorganismos."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"It was fortuitously discovered during a deep sea expedition. Its teeth have atrophied, so it now survives on microscopic organisms it sucks up."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"深海調査中 偶然に 発見 された。 歯が 退化し 吸うようにして 微生物を 取る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"On a longtemps cru son espèce disparue. Son nom serait une déformation du patronyme de la personne qui l’a découvert."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Se creía que esta especie se había extinguido. Le pusieron su nombre, Relicanth, en honor a su descubridor."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Thought to have gone extinct, Relicanth was given a name that is a variation of the name of the person who discovered it."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"絶滅したと 考えられていた。 ジーランスの 名は 発見者の 名前を もじって つけられた。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"On raconte que s’il n’a pas changé d’apparence en 100 millions d’années, c’est parce qu’il a atteint le stade de forme de vie parfaite."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"La razón por la que su aspecto no ha cambiado un ápice durante 100 millones de años se debe, al parecer, a que es una forma de vida perfecta."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"The reason it hasn’t changed at all in a hundred million years is that it’s apparently already a perfect life-form."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"１億年間 まったく 姿が 変わっていないのは 生命 として 完成 されているから らしい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il peut supporter la pression des profondeurs grâce à ses écailles aussi solides que le roc et à ses vessies natatoires remplies de graisse."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Es capaz de soportar la alta presión del fondo marino gracias a sus escamas, duras como rocas, y a sus vejigas natatorias llenas de grasa."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Rock-hard scales and oil-filled swim bladders allow this Pokémon to survive the intense water pressure of the deep sea."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"岩のように 硬い ウロコと 脂の 詰まった 浮袋で 深海の 水圧に 耐える。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Découvert lors d’une expédition dans les abysses, son apparence inchangée depuis 100 millions d’années lui a valu le surnom de « fossile vivant »."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Fue descubierto durante una expedición marina. Se lo considera un fósil viviente, pues no ha cambiado en cien millones de años."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"This Pokémon was discovered during deep-sea exploration. Its appearance hasn’t changed in 100,000,000 years, so it’s called a living fossil."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"深海調査で 発見された。 １億年間 姿が 変わらず 生きている化石 と 呼ばれている。"}],"varieties":[{"id":369,"moves":[{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[10,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[5,"level-up",29],[6,"level-up",29],[7,"level-up",29],[8,"level-up",29],[9,"level-up",29],[10,"level-up",29],[11,"level-up",29],[12,"level-up",29],[13,"level-up",29],[14,"level-up",29],[15,"level-up",29],[16,"level-up",31],[17,"level-